["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Walter Russell Mead - How America Keeps Winning - [Invest Like the Best, EP.490] Tech Hamiltonian info-structure Jacksonian soft blockade\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-08-ilt-让对手依赖你的体系-是美国赢了三百年的秘密/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aa91f50130802ffe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>讓對手依賴你的體系，是美國贏了三百年的秘密</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">荷蘭、英國、美國輪番當老大，靠的不是封鎖而是讓對手把身家性命押進自己的海洋體系——等它們離不開航路與市場，切斷就成了戰爭之外最有效的殺手鐧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美博弈</span><span class=\"tag\">海洋霸權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Is it time for a Luddite Renaissance? Luddite General Ned Ludd Enoch Frame Breaking Act\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-08-throughline-卢德分子不是反技术-是反失去议价权的自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c7f7bb336e16c273-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">16:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>盧德分子不是反技術，是反失去議價權的自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1812 年的盧德分子砸機器，是因為沒有選票、沒有工會，暴力是僅剩的談判手段；今天自稱新盧德分子的人有選票和言論自由，問題變成了要不要讓技術重塑人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 與就業</span><span class=\"tag\">勞工史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 221 Electroconvulsive Therapy Part 2: A current conversation Catatonia Anti-NMDA receptor encephalitis Succinylcholine Retrograde amnesia Transcranial magnetic stimulation (TMS)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-08-tpwky-ect-不是你想的那样-从密室到常规治疗的百年漂移/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>ECT 不是你想的那樣：從密室到常規治療的百年漂移</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">現代 ECT 是在麻醉和肌肉鬆弛劑下進行的程序，療效顯著，但有關記憶喪失的副作用證據仍不完全清楚，社會對此的誤解導致它被過度汙名化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">精神科</span><span class=\"tag\">電休克療法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"288: How Do I Help My Disorganized Teen? executive functioning time blindness metacognition natural consequences\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-08-asklisa-孩子丢三落四不是懒-是前额叶还没长好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/747ab52ea57af87e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">37:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>孩子丟三落四不是懶，是前額葉還沒長好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">14歲男孩的前額葉要到25歲才發育完，所以丟三落四不是態度問題。真正的問題是：家長自己的執行功能也不夠用，卻要替孩子搭一套他根本撐不住的系統。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年心理</span><span class=\"tag\">執行功能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"End of the Day Crazies With Kids party hat / professional hat yes time\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-08-unruffled-孩子放学回家就发疯-不是他变坏了-是他终于安全了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">27:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>孩子放學回家就發瘋，不是他變壞了，是他終於安全了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子把一天的壓力全部倒給最親的人，是正常且健康的；父母這時要戴的不是陪玩的「派對帽」，而是立規矩的「職業帽」，那才是真正的優質時間。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">情緒調節</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"我們如何老去？從《前浪》窺見中國老年生活的真實圖景 意定監護 軀體化 失獨家庭 空巢老人\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-08-cn300980-纪录片导演说-没有典型的老年-只有一个个具体的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda8c0f9bba83da6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"不\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">不合時宜</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>紀錄片導演說：沒有典型的老年，只有一個個具體的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">拍了兩季《前浪》的范世廣說，大多數婚姻走到最後是不鹹不淡甚至不好的，白頭偕老是鳳毛麟角；我們最缺的不是故事，是錢，和把老人當具體的人看。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">老齡化</span><span class=\"tag\">照護</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"谷歌AI風雲15年：諸神黃昏——發明未來的人為何錯過未來？ Transformer TPU 強化學習 稀疏模型 思維鏈 NeoLab\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-cnf65bb3-谷歌发明了-transformer-却把大模型时代让给了-openai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/216e9fe2cae1cec8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"科\"><span class=\"dur\">2:24:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">科技這碗飯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>谷歌發明了 Transformer，卻把大模型時代讓給了 OpenAI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">谷歌手裡同時握著 Transformer、TPU 和最多算力，卻因為搜索廣告的包袱和兩支 AI 團隊的內耗，把語言模型這條最關鍵的賽道讓給了 OpenAI。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">谷歌</span><span class=\"tag\">DeepMind</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Blowing Up Your Life jolt collateral jolt nuclear events divergent thinking convergent thinking three B&#x27;s\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-hiddenbrain-一次意外就能让你看清人生-但冲动辞职多半会后悔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>一次意外就能讓你看清人生，但衝動辭職多半會後悔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人生轉折點往往不是理性權衡的結果，而是一次意外事件把人踢出自動駕駛狀態；但研究顯示，衝動辭職多半會後悔，最聰明的反應有時是原地不動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">職業決策</span><span class=\"tag\">心理學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Six Impossible Episodes: Back-to-Court Substantial Disruption Test Establishment Clause reasonable suspicion probable cause corporal punishment closed-circuit recipients\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-stuffmissed-美国最高法院先给了学生宪法权利-后来又把搜包和体罚还给校园/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>美國最高法院先給了學生憲法權利，後來又把搜包和體罰還給校園</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">從拒絕向國旗敬禮到搜書包，六個判例逐漸畫出美國公立學校學生的憲法權利；最高法院一邊立下「學校不是極權飛地」，一邊承認體罰與合理懷疑搜包不違憲，權利邊界由此縮小。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國最高法院</span><span class=\"tag\">第一修正案</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"321. The Respect Effect: What Stereotype Threat Teaches Us About Communication stereotype threat churn disidentify\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-thinkfast-批评想被听进去-先给高期待与信任/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3e35d57ca15b5b1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">20:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Think Fast Talk Smart</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>批評想被聽進去，先給高期待與信任</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">批評想被採信，靠的不是先誇幾句，而是讓對方看到：標準是高的、你是有潛力的。實驗中只一句「標準高但你能達到」，黑人學生的改稿行動率就衝到最高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">刻板印象威脅</span><span class=\"tag\">反饋溝通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"367 | Jared Diamond on the Course of History and the Role of leaders natural experiment ANOVA regression to the mean dendrochronology\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-mindscape-希特勒死于1930年车祸-二战还会发生吗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>希特勒死於1930年車禍，二戰還會發生嗎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jared Diamond 用自然實驗回答「領袖何時重要」：CEO 大約解釋 30% 的利潤差異，而體育教練最大的作用不是戰術，是訓練球員別犯規。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">領導力</span><span class=\"tag\">歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Meritocracy, Exams, and the Knowledge That Matters (with Daisy Christodoulou) eight-legged essay far transfer near transfer identical elements mental discipline Northcote-Trevelyan Report\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-econtalk-拉丁文练不出外科医生-考试难-不如考得有用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>拉丁文練不出外科醫生：考試難，不如考得有用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">拉丁文練不出外科醫生：技能幾乎不遷移。如果認定「越難越能磨腦」，一國最聰明的人會被浪費在最無用的知識上——這就是清代科考的教訓。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育</span><span class=\"tag\">考試制度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can Open Source Keep AI Power From Concentrating? Attention is All You Need ensemble\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-a16z-ai-权力集中只是当下技术的结果-不是终局/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">8:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>AI 權力集中只是當下技術的結果，不是終局</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Transformer 靠海量數據和算力才聰明，所以權力集中在買得起數據中心的大公司手裡；但 Transformer 還不到十年，人類大腦就是小數據專家的存在證明。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Gordon Brown: The Future Starts with Us thumos motivated reasoning middle power circles of sympathy bridging capital The Last Man\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-startweek-民粹不是赢在说服-而是填补民间组织的真空/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8fc04a8d1e9204fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">42:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Start the Week</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>民粹不是贏在說服，而是填補民間組織的真空</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Brown 的判斷是，民粹政黨不是靠說服贏得支持，而是走進被削弱的民間組織留下的空位——45% 的英國人沒有加入任何組織，志願服務率從 27% 跌到 17%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民粹主義</span><span class=\"tag\">公民社會</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Stephen Miran on Regulatory Dominance, Shrinking the Fed&#x27;s Balance Sheet, and the Return of Monetarism regulatory dominance Divisia monetary aggregates FEMA HQLA LCR ample reserves\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-macromusings-美联储缩表能砍掉两万亿-但没人敢碰这个约束/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/94856b33a0db697f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">55:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Macro Musings</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>美聯儲縮表能砍掉兩萬億，但沒人敢碰這個約束</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美聯儲資產負債表六萬多億，其中三萬億是準備金。Miran 的菜單說，只要壓低準備金需求，就能在不擾動短端市場的前提下縮掉一到兩萬億——前提是承認監管才是真正的約束。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美聯儲</span><span class=\"tag\">縮表</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.234 宏觀漫談110｜全球流動性的困境與中國五類經濟主體的金融結構轉型（9.2錄製） Capex FOMO Mega 7\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-cn38ff4a-全球流动性见顶-上半年越激进砸-ai-的公司-越先被折价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c8ab7cfc7806449c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"高\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">高能量</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>全球流動性見頂：上半年越激進砸 AI 的公司，越先被折價</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">資本市場的上漲必須有新錢持續接盤。全球流動性已經露出見頂跡象，上半年最激進投 AI 的公司，正從被獎勵變為被折價。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">流動性</span><span class=\"tag\">AI資本開支</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Money Launderers Love $100 Bills seigniorage trade-based money laundering Vancouver model banknote paradox SAR (Suspicious Activity Report)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-oddlots-央行不愿废除百元美钞-那是一笔-2-5-万亿无息贷款/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">54:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>央行不願廢除百元美鈔：那是一筆 2.5 萬億無息貸款</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">現金使用越來越少，流通中的美元卻創新高。央行有動力繼續印 100 美元紙鈔：這筆錢實質是美國政府 2.5 萬億美元的無息貸款，代價是給全球洗錢者提供便利。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">洗錢</span><span class=\"tag\">反洗錢</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Are Rumors of an Imminent Russian Attack Warranted? | Yaroslav Trofimov Article 5 Suwalki Gap Minsk-1 / Minsk-2 Operation Spiderweb\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-hiddenforces-俄罗斯陷在乌克兰-仍有余力对北约开新战线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b4203c8f6331570-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">49:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Forces</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>俄羅斯陷在烏克蘭，仍有餘力對北約開新戰線</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">俄軍在烏克蘭沒有取勝，但消耗戰喂出了世界最尖端的無人機步兵戰經驗；嘉賓認為它完全有餘力對北約發動一次有限試探，窗口就在特朗普任期的最後階段。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄烏戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 399: Dan Dennett&#x27;s Model of Mind (Part Two) multiple drafts model heterophenomenology phi phenomenon qualia illusionism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-pel-意识不是剧场-dennett-说体验就是判断本身/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1e15495695462c4f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>意識不是劇場：Dennett 說體驗就是判斷本身</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dennett 的「多重草稿」模型否認大腦裡有個中央屏幕：沒有「先感覺、後判斷」兩步，體驗本身就是一堆並行判斷的蒸餾物。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心靈哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">意識</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Battle of New York Explained short war fallacy fortification creep Hessians Jamaica Pass\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-historyhit-纽约战役-豪将军三次放走华盛顿-美国才活了下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/67680fd5ac05eafe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:42:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>紐約戰役：豪將軍三次放走華盛頓，美國才活了下來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英軍的目標是消滅華盛頓的軍隊，不是佔領城市。豪將軍三次讓到手的獵物溜走，華盛頓則學會了一件事：只要軍隊還在，美國就還活著。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">獨立戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">軍事戰略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Why Your Preschooler Is Hitting, Biting, or Kicking (And What Helps) autonomy kindergarten readiness accommodation power-over model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-07-parentmojo-孩子打咬踢不是坏行为-是在夺回身体自主权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>孩子打咬踢不是壞行為，是在奪回身體自主權</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">別再問怎麼讓打人停止。三四歲孩子的打咬踢，常常是身體被成人幾乎掌控一切後，僅剩的喊出「我沒有發言權」的工具——給回一點選擇，行為才會減少。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">學齡前</span><span class=\"tag\">幼兒攻擊行為</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"703. Roman Civil War: Marching on the Senate (Part 3) pomerium popularis Cinnanum Tempus Hellespont\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-06-restishistory-罗马将军带兵打进首都-元老院却宣布他是合法执政/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>羅馬將軍帶兵打進首都，元老院卻宣布他是合法執政</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">蘇拉帶六個軍團跨過神聖邊界攻入羅馬，把馬略定為公敵；他前腳東征，馬略後腳反攻倒算，第七次當選執政官後醉死。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅馬史</span><span class=\"tag\">政治極化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Flood that Wrecked the Hard Disk Drive Industry industrial estate slider La Niña cartelize\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-06-asianometry-泰国洪水重创硬盘业-最大的厂跌倒-老二捡了王座/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cdd681ba1ae2c3c7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">19:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>泰國洪水重創硬盤業：最大的廠跌倒，老二撿了王座</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">泰國一場洪水改寫了硬盤座次：最大廠 Western Digital 出貨環比跌51%，Seagate 只跌8%，反超登頂。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬盤</span><span class=\"tag\">泰國</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"393. Road To 9/11: Interviewing Bin Laden In The Caves of Tora Bora (Part 5) fatwa Alec Station B-roll PNG\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-06-empirehist-本-拉登1997年就宣战了-美国四年后才听懂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">47:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>本·拉登1997年就宣戰了，美國四年後才聽懂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1997年CNN拍下本·拉登首次電視宣戰，當時幾乎無人注意；真正讓美國醒過來的是1998年兩座使館被炸——他要的不是很多人看，是很多人死。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">反恐</span><span class=\"tag\">情報機構</span>\n</div></div></a>"]